    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the ice only helps for like 5 mins then it's back to hurting. i feel like if i could just get that nerve to pop back into place it would fix everything. i read that intense yoga stretches like pigeon pose or even just twisting hard can help release that pressure. if i'm really careful and just do it slowly do u think that's okay to try to get some relief tonight?",
